@EventEase_HostAddress = http://localhost:5139

### 🔑 1. AUTHENTICATION & PROFILE SERVICES

# 1.0 Register User
POST {{EventEase_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "New Customer",
  "email": "customer@demo.com",
  "password": "JoinEvents@2025",
  "phone": "9876543210"
}

###

# 1.1 Authenticate User (Login)
POST {{EventEase_HostAddress}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "customer@demo.com",
  "password": "JoinEvents@2025"
}

###

# 1.2 Get User Profile
GET {{EventEase_HostAddress}}/api/v1/profile
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Accept: application/json

###

# 1.3 Update User Password
PUT {{EventEase_HostAddress}}/api/v1/profile/password
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "currentPassword": "JoinEvents@2025",
  "newPassword": "NewSecurePassword@2026"
}


### 🛍️ 2. CUSTOMER PORTAL SERVICES

# 2.1 Search Event Packages
GET {{EventEase_HostAddress}}/api/v1/packages/search?city=Hyderabad&eventTypeId=wedding&priceMin=100000&priceMax=500000
Accept: application/json

###

# 2.2 Submit Custom Event Plan (RFP)
POST {{EventEase_HostAddress}}/api/v1/customer/rfp
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "My Custom Anniversary Event",
  "eventDate": "2026-12-15",
  "city": "Hyderabad",
  "guestCount": 250,
  "budgetMin": 80000,
  "budgetMax": 100000,
  "requirements": "Need premium floral decor and south indian food menu.",
  "servicesNeeded": ["Catering", "Decoration"]
}

###

# 2.3 Accept Vendor Bid
POST {{EventEase_HostAddress}}/api/v1/customer/rfp/99011223-3300-0000-0000-000000000000/bids/44556600-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/accept
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Accept: application/json


### 🏢 3. VENDOR PORTAL SERVICES

# 3.1 Upload Verification Documents
POST {{EventEase_HostAddress}}/api/v1/vendor/verification/documents
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="documentType"

GST Certificate
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="gst_cert.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

<pdf_bytes_here_or_blank>
--boundary--

###

# 3.2 Place Bid on Customer RFP
POST {{EventEase_HostAddress}}/api/v1/vendor/rfp/99011223-3300-0000-0000-000000000000/bid
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "proposedAmount": 95000,
  "description": "Premium floral backdrop and custom 4-course menu setup.",
  "deliverables": [
    "Floral Stage Background",
    "4-Course Buffet Catering",
    "10 Buffet Servers"
  ],
  "validUntil": "2026-05-20"
}

###

# 3.3 Get Vendor Business Dashboard Analytics
GET {{EventEase_HostAddress}}/api/v1/vendor/analytics
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Accept: application/json


### 🛡️ 4. ADMIN & MODERATION SERVICES

# 4.1 Moderate Vendor Account Status
POST {{EventEase_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/vendors/usr_v100-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/moderate
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "action": "suspend",
  "reason": "Repeated non-compliance with hygiene ratings",
  "duration": "30 days"
}

###

# 4.2 Review Verification Document
PUT {{EventEase_HostAddress}}/api/v1/admin/verification/documents/doc_8899-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "approved",
  "rejectionReason": ""
}


### 🔍 5. SUPPORT & BOOKING MONITOR SERVICES

# 5.1 Append Support Log
POST {{EventEase_HostAddress}}/api/v1/support/bookings/bk001000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/logs
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Called customer to confirm stage setup lighting preferences."
}

###

# 5.2 Remind Vendor
POST {{EventEase_HostAddress}}/api/v1/support/reminders/vendor
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "vendorId": "usr_v100-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "bookingId": "bk001000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000"
}

###

# 5.3 Manage Support Ticket Status
PUT {{EventEase_HostAddress}}/api/v1/support/tickets/tkt_1122-3300-0000-0000-000000000000
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "resolved",
  "assignedTo": "usr_s1"
}


### 💬 6. LIVE MESSENGER SERVICES

# 6.1 Get Active Conversations
GET {{EventEase_HostAddress}}/api/v1/messenger/threads
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Accept: application/json

###

# 6.2 Send New Chat Message
POST {{EventEase_HostAddress}}/api/v1/messenger/threads/th_8877-6600-0000-0000-000000000000/messages
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "Thank you! The draft looks incredible. Please proceed."
}


### 🔔 7. IN-APP NOTIFICATION SERVICES

# 7.1 Retrieve Active Notifications
GET {{EventEase_HostAddress}}/api/v1/notifications
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Accept: application/json

###

# 7.2 Mark All Notifications as Read
PUT {{EventEase_HostAddress}}/api/v1/notifications/read-all
Authorization: Bearer <token>
Accept: application/json

